{"check":"subject-mutations","checkedDigest":"ed5e7afe0dab3e83f960140bfda071307e68d87412ba28705c743ef6a4b4e6a6","checkedPaths":["bin/dotpush-test","bin/pi-update-safe-test","bin/tmux-setup-test","bin/vps-pgdump-test","config/ai/runtime-commands.txt"],"detail":"Five mutations of the four subjects, each the shape a real bug would take: dotpush ignoring a missing scanner and ignoring a failing scan, tmux-setup deleting a user file instead of backing it up, vps-pgdump loosening umask 077 to 022, and vps-pgdump accepting a candidate that pg_isready rejected. One escaped at first \u2014 with the missing-scanner branch disabled the next branch still aborts, so asserting only \"it aborted\" could not tell them apart. The two messages point at different fixes, and the case now asserts the specific one. All five bite.","eventHash":"0d923e7944442e005c4f66b27b4ff7057f86ce8d2e800d13f210190a2eeda197","eventId":"d4d441c9ba984a9aa32b8075a667847e","executed":null,"head":"339200ee72fd1dfb5ac8ab49ed2babd2ca237c26","prevEventHash":"fa99083dbf7dbe7173d2dca1dea9d7af8aca36a9eab16b8b8a195d59db0df0fc","runId":"RUN-20260910T170244Z-1901f9e4","state":null,"status":"PASS","time":"2026-09-10T17:07:42Z","type":"verification"}
{"check":"no-live-side-effects","checkedDigest":"ed5e7afe0dab3e83f960140bfda071307e68d87412ba28705c743ef6a4b4e6a6","checkedPaths":["bin/dotpush-test","bin/pi-update-safe-test","bin/tmux-setup-test","bin/vps-pgdump-test","config/ai/runtime-commands.txt"],"detail":"None of the four reaches a network, installs, or reads a secret. dotpush runs against a fixture HOME whose repository has no remote, so a regression past the refusal fails on a missing remote rather than pushing. tmux-setup refuses apt-get and brew outright and refuses only git clone and fetch \u2014 the local rev-parse/cat-file/checkout it uses to pin TPM are legitimate, and a blanket git shim made the test report a violation that was not one. vps-pgdump never invokes the real ssh; every call is logged and asserted. pi-update-safe drives a shim pi.","eventHash":"891d9fcee38cbed7362e621c59a6210a89f632c84fa964b902c0ba5d63f7c364","eventId":"f91383af98694191bc77cd365face6f8","executed":null,"head":"339200ee72fd1dfb5ac8ab49ed2babd2ca237c26","prevEventHash":"0d923e7944442e005c4f66b27b4ff7057f86ce8d2e800d13f210190a2eeda197","runId":"RUN-20260910T170244Z-1901f9e4","state":null,"status":"PASS","time":"2026-09-10T17:07:43Z","type":"verification"}
